<title>SWEDEN: Securitas sees '97 in line with previous years.</title>
<headline>Securitas sees '97 in line with previous years.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish security company Securitas said on Tuesday it expected its 1997 result to be in line with previous years' earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;For the full-year result development is expected to be in line with previous years',&quot; it said in its first quarter earnings statement.</p>
</text>
